00:12:58.900 --> 00:12:59.740
but it just felt,

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.980
very awkward,

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.160
like, how often,

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.460
and, because when I think,

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.460
to like the classic beat em up games,

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:10.000
