00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.680
and you're going to fight,

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.960
in this, in this alleyway,

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.340
and, like,

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.200
there's sort of like,

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.260
an internal consistency,

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.640
