00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.980
and then, you're gonna clear the stage,

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.580
the mini, like the,

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:29.160
the stage part,

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.420
