that's sort of, what I gathered,

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:56.600
but we're, yeah, it's,

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.020
this is a very specific thing,

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.600
yeah, it's a very specific thing,

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.000
that was noticeable a lot though,

