do you think that it's,

00:34:16.800 --> 00:34:19.200
um, do you think that it matters at all,

00:34:19.320 --> 00:34:21.040
that, you know, we only had three options,

00:34:21.260 --> 00:34:23.140
in this game, but even the arcade version,

